    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x15C22; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Conversion between the VVEL control-shaft angle (axis, 1/512 degree) and the command-word domain (values), read in both directions by the task. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x15c22 bound to accessor 0x5514a through literal 0x5531c, accessor 0x5e2a0 through literal 0x5e9b4, accessor 0x5f468 through literal 0x5f588. Read by the task FUN_0005E2A0 at callsites 0x5E886 and 0x5E8F4, by the resolver FUN_0005F468 at 0x5F51A and 0x5F52E, and by FUN_0005514A at 0x55168 and 0x55188 through the 16-point uint16 wrapper 0x2893C. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x000156FC. 1ND3B shares the 1ND0A code layout and its stock bytes at this address.</description>
