    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x8F74; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint16; map confidence candidate. Calibrated inclusive readiness threshold for stationary rev-limiter accumulator ffff16a6. FUN 0004f324 sets readiness bit 4 of ffff247f when the accumulator is greater than or equal to this scalar and its secondary gate passes. The stock value is 381 accumulator counts. The threshold controls readiness for stationary fuel-cut/restore hysteresis 000085d9/000085da. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000911c through JK08A-1ND.definition-addresses.csv: homologous readiness state machine preserves the 0x04b0 threshold role.</description>
