    <title>VVEL Duration Target - Start-up [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x16440; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Start-up duration used by modes 2 and 11: the curve by the selected temperature, scaled by 0.05, with the same ramp alternative as JK78C. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x16440 bound to accessor 0x5f9f0 through literal 0x5fb08. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x*0.05 deg; proposed editor-grid inverse x/0.05. Origin: the retained layout interpretation and defs/JK78C.vvel.md:409-441, defs/JK78C.vvel.md:478-505, vvel_duration_startup_axis/axis. The selected-temperature axis proof and startup selector do not establish the ordinate unit. The returned table quantity is distinct from its axis-coordinate quantity and from the paired command-word domain. Recorded code and catalog interpretation: Read by FUN_0005F9F0 at callsite 0x5FAAE through the 16-point uint16 wrapper 0x2893C. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x00015E32. 1ND3B shares the 1ND0A code layout and its stock bytes at this address. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
