    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x170A2; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Mode 3 intake-cam target of the VVEL selector, interpolated by the coolant-coded byte of the cold axis. Stock values are 0x8000 = 0 at every point. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x170a2 bound to accessor 0x5f468 through literal 0x5f7bc. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: (x-32768)*0.5 degCA; proposed editor-grid inverse x*2+32768. Origin: the retained layout interpretation and defs/JK78C.vvel.md:409-428, defs/JK78C.vvel.md:495-505. The resolver arithmetic establishes a centered numeric output only where the recorded conversion path is given. It does not establish physical camshaft/crankshaft degrees. Uniform zero counts cannot prove a slope. A proved RPM or temperature coordinate does not prove the table output unit. Recorded code and catalog interpretation: Read by the resolver FUN_0005F468 at callsite 0x5F6EC through the 8-point uint16 wrapper 0x28910 with its own literal pool word. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x00016A94. 1ND3B shares the 1ND0A code layout and its stock bytes at this address. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
