  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xFAA4" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 4 - Timing-State Addend - Default/Post-Transition</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x134090; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. Default/post-transition eight-point timing-state addend in FUN 0004afdc. It is selected whenever the stock-inert feature path and warm transition path are not selected and the separate state-3/bit-7 constant bypass is not active. The interpolated result enters ffff1511 through the exact x-128 transform. Common-definition Map 4 storage is projected from 0x13C12. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. The separate constant path selects raw 0x9e, or +30 counts, when ffff22ff=3 and ffff2458.bit7=1. Target-vehicle A/B evidence isolates 00012196 during matched warm deceleration: a 16-count slot difference at 4000..4400 RPM produced the same 16-count median final-coordinate shift with no corresponding fuel-word shift. This proves one-for-one software-coordinate propagation and makes the catalog Cold Idle qualifier nonexclusive. The alternate compositor branch of 0004bdc2 forms ffff1830=clamp_s8(ffff1a7d+ffff23ee-ffff23c5-64) at 0004be82 and shares the ffff2404 -&gt; ffff2378 -&gt; ffff12d6 -&gt; ffff11da -&gt; ffff11d4 chain of coefficient 1 with the low-seven surfaces, and J1979 PID 0x0E publishes ffff11d4 as A/2-64 degBTDC, so one count of this map is one crank degree of the declared coordinate. Index: implicit 1D-8 over ffff11b2 with nodes 0,32,...224 and saturation at element 7. Result disposition: writes (RAM ffff1511, site 0004b0d0). Definition address projected from JK08A 00012196 through JK08A-1ND.definition-addresses.csv: homologous fallback branch preserves the default table role.</description>
