    <title>Map 4 - Engine Speed Limit - Fuel Cut Caps</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x1324FC; 1 rows x 2 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Native VQ37 fuel-cut activation and release scalar caps. Common-definition Map 4 storage is projected from 0x91D2. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. Exact 1ND3B native fuel-cut model at 0x76ad2; selector 0xfffe80ed, shared axis 0x17072. The BSR at coordinator instruction ordinal 223 targets FUN_00076ad2, the first Boolean predicate aggregated by the final fuel-mask coordinator. Its 190-byte implementation preserves the JK78C cap, interpolation, activation, release, and hysteresis structure with target-local storage and RAM state.</description>
