    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x133F7B; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Captured-RPM ratio (%) used for adaptive Rolling Launch hysteresis The runtime rounds captured_rpm * ratio / 100 to native RPM units once at activation, then clamps the result between the configured minimum and maximum hysteresis.</description>
